# Ruta 14 (C5a, contract 47), 34 x 16. column = i, row = j. Ruta 13 arrives at the EAST edge (i = 33, rows 7..8), Ruta 15 is the WEST edge (i = 0, rows 1..2).
# Look (the user's mock "Rutas 13-14", the other axis: the fences run NORTH - SOUTH): five columns of low fences (`rfence_j`) with the gaps alternately at the north and at the south end make the road zig-zag west through
# six wildflower strips; tall-grass patches in the strips, hedges (cuttable-less bushes) and boulders in the corners (its own touch), five trainers (bird keepers, bikers, a punk and a lass).
@map ruta_14
@size 34 16
@interior no
@area ruta_14
@bg 0
@fill wildf
@spawn east 32 7 W
@spawn west 1 1 E
@encounters grass rate=20
  mossbud 30 32 25
  flitwing 30 32 20
  shellfern 30 32 15
  jabhawk 31 33 20
  lanternmoth 30 32 10
  mossbloom 30 32 10
  foldling 30 32 5
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, normal route): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 4 (4/256 per step).
@open_rate 4
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=wildf
  a  object=tree
  b  object=rfence_j
  c  tile=tall_grass
  d  npc=explorador id=t1 face=S trainer=explorador_r14 range=3 text=tr.explorador_r14.pre after=tr.explorador_r14.after
  e  object=bush
  f  object=boulder
  g  object=flowerbed
  h  object=sign text=ruta14.sign interact=look
  i  object=sign text=ruta14.sign2 interact=look
  j  item=antidote
  k  item=rich_salve
  l  npc=mama id=npc_a face=SW text=ruta14.npc
  m  npc=rider id=t2 face=N trainer=rider_r14a range=3 text=tr.rider_r14a.pre after=tr.rider_r14a.after
  n  npc=punk id=t3 face=S trainer=punk_r14 range=3 text=tr.punk_r14.pre after=tr.punk_r14.after
  o  npc=chica id=t4 face=N trainer=chica_r14 range=3 text=tr.chica_r14.pre after=tr.chica_r14.after
  p  npc=rider id=t5 face=S trainer=rider_r14b range=3 text=tr.rider_r14b.pre after=tr.rider_r14b.after
  q  tile=wildf
  r  tile=wildf
  H  tile=wildf hidden=growth_seed   # F2 (contract 74): a hidden item
@grid
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
  r.........b.f........jb..........a
  r.........b...........b.f........a
  a...b.....bcccc.b..e..b.....bcccca
  a..ib..e..bcccc.b.....b..l..bcdcca
  a...b.p...bcccc.b..n..bcccc.bcccca
  a...b.....bcccc.b.....bcccc.b..h.a
  a...b.....b.....bcccc.bcccc.b....q
  a...bcccc.b.....bcccc.bcccc.b..e.q
  a...bcccc.b..e..bcccc.b.....b....a
  a...bcccc.b.....bcccc.b..m..bcccca
  a...bcccc.b..o..b.....b...g.bcccca
  a.e.b.....b...g.b.....b..e..bcccca
  a.H.b...........b.f.........b....a
  a...b.f..k......b...........b.f..a
  aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@warp q -> ruta_13 spawn=west
@warp r -> ruta_15 spawn=east
